  m_Name: Chairman Roth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Chairman Roth
  offerText: Your extensive private library is a waste of square footage. I am buying
    it all to pulp the paper for my factories. You will be well compensated, though
    you will have nothing left to read.
  acceptResultText: Roth's men pack up every single book. You have plenty of floor
    space and a fat wallet, but staring at the empty shelves leaves you utterly depressed.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to sell your books. Roth is deeply insulted and sends
    a thug to smash your reading glasses and physically rough you up.
